- base_node_id: family_partitioned_staged
- title: Tile adjacent time outputs and reuse the projection halo
- difficulty_1_to_5: 3
- description: Replace the one-row-per-program convolution kernel with a small time-by-channel tile. Load each B and x_proj value in the causal halo once, compute multiple adjacent convolution outputs, apply their corresponding C gates, and preserve the existing packed input and regular output GEMMs.
